# Backend: everything under sentinel/
user backend
topic readwrite sentinel/#

# Devices (username = cert CN = own 12-hex id): publish only their own uplink topics,
# read only their own downlink topics. A device cannot read another device's feedback
# or spoof another device's events.
pattern write sentinel/%u/event
pattern write sentinel/%u/status
pattern write sentinel/%u/clip/+
pattern read  sentinel/%u/feedback
pattern read  sentinel/%u/ota/+
